{"data":[{"conversation_id":"2096818216748364009","created_at":"2026-09-07T04:29:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2096818216748364009"],"id":"2096818216748364009","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1927,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"马斯克是不是已经比美国政府还强？\n\n如果SpaceX把核弹头送上太空，倾泻而下，哪个国家挡得住？\n\n如果Tesla量产无人坦克，涌入市中心，警察靠什么拦？血肉之躯？\n\n他还有X，能影响你如何理解这一切。\n\n离超级大国，他还差什么？"},{"conversation_id":"2085862728456151212","created_at":"2026-08-07T22:56:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085862728456151212"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":137,"id":"874126509245476864","start":125,"username":"DarioAmodei"},{"end":146,"id":"159337660","start":138,"username":"bcherny"}]},"id":"2085862728456151212","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1511,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我用Claude Code桌面版已经有一段时间了。bug太多，产品设计思路感觉很仓促、不够打磨。举个具体例子：跨端体验很差——用手机端访问/查看桌面agent的状态，体验极其糟糕。老实说现在不如Codex好用。用cli的思维做GUI的软件，这样会输的@DarioAmodei @bcherny"},{"conversation_id":"2085861760763105510","created_at":"2026-08-07T22:52:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085861760763105510"],"id":"2085861760763105510","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1312,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"微软还在叫copilot吗？所有传统软件加一个问答框的所谓copilot都是传统软件的自以为是。\n\n所有新的创新都会是一个独立的agent，传统软件都只是它外部可配置的工具而已。\n\n独立agent，自己在那主动干活，而不是像copilot一样被人驱动"},{"conversation_id":"2085545131621724573","created_at":"2026-08-07T01:54:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085545131621724573"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/rohanpaul_ai/s…","end":194,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2085524884462182426","start":171,"url":"https://t.co/vsvHAwFrIY"}]},"id":"2085545131621724573","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1202,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我不太认同\"算力受限让Anthropic更节省\"\n\n两家技术运维效率应差不太多，长期也会收敛。更可能是收入结构：OpenAI偏2C（免费用户多、服务成本高难变现），Anthropic偏2B（用量更直接转付费）。这个比例差异，才是烧钱差距的真正根源。\n\n现在看codex要赢claude code，未来OpenAI的token收益率也会涨起来 https://t.co/vsvHAwFrIY"},{"conversation_id":"2085544216760046009","created_at":"2026-08-07T01:51:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085544216760046009"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/rohanpaul_ai/s…","end":164,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2085524884462182426","start":141,"url":"https://t.co/vsvHAwFrIY"}]},"id":"2085544216760046009","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1171,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这个\"低80%\"不是指单token的成本对比。\n\nGavin自己的原话是——这是指烧到同等收入规模所花的资本。\n\nAnthropic为了达到差不多的ARR，总共比OpenAI少烧了约80%的钱——这是\"烧钱换收入\"的效率指标，不是说Anthropic的单token成本便宜80%。 https://t.co/vsvHAwFrIY"}],"meta":{"newest_id":"2096818216748364009","next_token":"7140dibdnow9c7btwoxjdfcy620g0a80ia2pnqm5bxzcp","oldest_id":"2085544216760046009","result_count":5}}